1
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:28,660
(THE YARNS)

2
00:01:12,938 --> 00:01:14,800
The victim was around 70 years old.

3
00:01:15,112 --> 00:01:17,709
The initial assumption is that the cause of death was likely due to physical assault.

4
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,400
There are bruises around the neck.

5
00:01:19,585 --> 00:01:21,512
And the victim’s nails show
signs of scratching the perpetrator.

6
00:01:21,694 --> 00:01:23,120
We’re getting closer to the truth.

7
00:01:23,530 --> 00:01:24,436
It’s in here

8
00:01:24,789 --> 00:01:26,301
So that’s mean this girl

9
00:01:26,450 --> 00:01:29,018
witnessed the serial killer murdering the priest.

10
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,741
The CCTV footage collected from Miss Sookwan neighborhood

11
00:01:31,850 --> 00:01:33,214
on the night of incident

12
00:01:33,887 --> 00:01:36,381
DNA from the lollipop and the DNA of the killer

13
00:01:36,469 --> 00:01:37,680
are 98% matched

14
00:01:37,938 --> 00:01:40,109
You have no right to do this! What are you doing!

15
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,440
- Stop! You cannot go inside!
- I have to search your room, Sky.

16
00:02:35,203 --> 00:02:36,218
How is this possible, inspector?

17
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,047
All the pictures here, they..

18
00:02:38,138 --> 00:02:39,752
Exactly match with all cases.

19
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,443
Collect evidence

20
00:02:42,127 --> 00:02:43,690
and arrest the suspect.

21
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:49,920
- Sky didn’t do it! How can you do this to her?!
- Ouch, it hurts!

22
00:02:51,981 --> 00:02:52,632
Sky

23
00:02:54,025 --> 00:02:57,160
I’ll let my friend here take you to the police station.

24
00:02:58,076 --> 00:03:03,440
A police station is where people go to file complaints or arrest the bad people.

25
00:03:04,265 --> 00:03:06,978
I didn’t have any complaints,
and I didn’t do anything wrong

26
00:03:07,225 --> 00:03:08,640
Why do I have to go?

27
00:03:08,854 --> 00:03:10,923
- Why do I have to go?
- Sky

28
00:03:12,450 --> 00:03:13,770
We have to get something done.

29
00:03:14,803 --> 00:03:16,127
Your mom is going with us too

30
00:03:17,676 --> 00:03:19,080
Mom, you are going too?

31
00:03:19,534 --> 00:03:21,036
Are you really going with me?

32
00:03:21,076 --> 00:03:23,610
Yes, Sky. I’m going with you.

33
00:03:25,778 --> 00:03:27,345
Ok, I’ll go.

34
00:03:28,443 --> 00:03:31,180
Why do you bring your
police friends to search my room?

35
00:03:31,447 --> 00:03:32,380
I don’t like this.

36
00:03:32,727 --> 00:03:33,847
Really don’t like this at all.

37
00:03:42,992 --> 00:03:46,341
Lun, these match all cases like copy-paste.

38
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:50,189
Hey, could it be that Sky knit these
yarns after seeing the news?

39
00:03:51,083 --> 00:03:53,476
Then, the question is why does she have to hide it?

40
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,334
Believe it or not,

41
00:03:58,080 --> 00:04:01,069
Sky's DNA showed up so clearly
that she is the one who did it.

42
00:04:04,978 --> 00:04:07,134
Can an autistic kid really kill someone like this, sis?

43
00:04:07,527 --> 00:04:09,185
But this case is not that normal.

44
00:04:09,509 --> 00:04:11,036
That’s something we need to think about.

45
00:04:11,407 --> 00:04:13,832
Miss Sookwan used to be a surgical nurse,

46
00:04:14,661 --> 00:04:16,076
She could have taught Sky.

47
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:21,854
Is... Sky really a murderer?

48
00:04:23,032 --> 00:04:24,098
If not

49
00:04:24,436 --> 00:04:27,100
She might have multiple personality disorder,
like Lan suspected.

50
00:04:27,530 --> 00:04:28,780
Multiple personality disorder?

51
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,730
Uh… Inspector

52
00:04:33,236 --> 00:04:34,450
How is Sky doing now?

53
00:04:56,981 --> 00:05:00,800
Why did you bring me here? Why did you lock me up?

54
00:05:02,967 --> 00:05:04,047
I’m here to visit my daughter.

55
00:05:11,738 --> 00:05:14,192
Hey Sky… Sky.

56
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,680
Sky

57
00:05:16,327 --> 00:05:17,218
Sky

58
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,872
Sky, I’m here to see you.

59
00:05:19,180 --> 00:05:20,440
-Sky
-Hello,

60
00:05:21,105 --> 00:05:22,450
Could you open it for me please.

61
00:05:29,865 --> 00:05:30,829
Sky

62
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,552
Thank you

63
00:05:50,541 --> 00:05:51,334
Sky

64
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:55,072
Sky, do you want to decode something?

65
00:06:00,578 --> 00:06:01,872
Decode?

66
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:05,618
Well,

67
00:06:06,258 --> 00:06:07,712
I’m playing Sudoku

68
00:06:09,389 --> 00:06:10,538
Do you wanna play?

69
00:06:12,872 --> 00:06:14,429
Then, I’ll let you continue this, alright?

70
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,040
Miss Sookwan…

71
00:06:32,098 --> 00:06:34,858
You should hurry and go get Sky’s medical certificate,

72
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,567
and her medical history

73
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,272
to confirm and prove that she is really autistic.

74
00:06:39,050 --> 00:06:41,287
Then we can help proceed in separate confinement for Sky.

75
00:06:41,421 --> 00:06:44,843
There will be a specialist
monitoring her during the confinement.

76
00:06:45,163 --> 00:06:46,898
Right, I’ll go get them now.

77
00:06:50,309 --> 00:06:51,781
Please take care of Sky

78
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,389
No worries

79
00:07:54,621 --> 00:07:55,229
Doctor

80
00:07:55,350 --> 00:07:56,349
Do you have any other ways

81
00:07:56,400 --> 00:08:00,290
for us to get more information from Sky?

82
00:08:00,996 --> 00:08:03,298
The main problem of this case

83
00:08:03,436 --> 00:08:05,418
is the communication, inspector.

84
00:08:06,956 --> 00:08:10,407
We need to find a way to help her express herself

85
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:13,465
From what I’ve been talking to Sky,

86
00:08:14,301 --> 00:08:15,810
Does she have a multiple personality disorder?

87
00:08:16,141 --> 00:08:17,421
It’s hard to say so.

88
00:08:17,960 --> 00:08:19,403
it takes time to diagnose

89
00:08:19,821 --> 00:08:22,880
we have to closely observe her behaviour and see whether she has other hidden personalities

90
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:27,640
By the way, you’ve mentioned
this disorder a few times already

91
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:35,080
Are you afraid that one of
Sky's personalities… is a murderer?

92
00:08:40,498 --> 00:08:41,523
Excuse me for now.

93
00:08:41,716 --> 00:08:43,640
-Thank you
-You’re welcome

94
00:08:50,672 --> 00:08:51,392
Miss Sookwan

95
00:08:52,552 --> 00:08:54,443
Is there anything I can help with? You arrive quite early.

96
00:08:55,287 --> 00:08:56,003
No, nothing

97
00:08:56,380 --> 00:08:57,774
Then, let’s meet around 1 pm.

98
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,021
I need to question you.

99
00:09:00,036 --> 00:09:00,836
Sure

100
00:09:01,861 --> 00:09:02,923
Excuse me

101
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:04,570
Uh…

102
00:09:05,367 --> 00:09:06,280
Inspector

103
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:09,520
You've been with Sky for a while now

104
00:09:09,814 --> 00:09:11,000
Do you really believe that

105
00:09:11,770 --> 00:09:14,054
this simple-heart girl

106
00:09:14,741 --> 00:09:16,520
who cannot even make a direct eye contact

107
00:09:17,980 --> 00:09:19,894
could really kill someone?

108
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,989
I didn’t do it

109
00:09:32,265 --> 00:09:33,836
I didn’t kill anyone

110
00:09:34,196 --> 00:09:35,516
I didn’t kill the boxer

111
00:09:35,876 --> 00:09:37,770
I didn’t kill the banker

112
00:09:37,985 --> 00:09:41,923
didn’t kill P’Ya, didn’t kill Khun Anon
even though he hurted me.

113
00:09:41,980 --> 00:09:43,345
didn’t kill the monk.

114
00:09:43,447 --> 00:09:46,825
Didn’t kill Teacher Rapeephan. Didn’t kill the priest

115
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,360
Sky, Sky, Sky

116
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:52,734
If Sky didn’t kill them,
how do you know all this information?

117
00:10:04,003 --> 00:10:04,956
It’s okay, Sky

118
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:08,181
I’ll show you … this photo

119
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,807
Sky, look at these yarns

120
00:10:14,865 --> 00:10:17,127
Are you the one knitting these yarn?

121
00:10:18,810 --> 00:10:19,400
Yes

122
00:10:19,832 --> 00:10:21,738
I knitted these yarns myself

123
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,523
all by myself

124
00:10:23,865 --> 00:10:24,912
why?

125
00:10:26,272 --> 00:10:29,836
Why did you knit them into these pictures?
Where did you see them?

126
00:10:33,309 --> 00:10:34,320
Um..

127
00:10:40,505 --> 00:10:43,330
I don’t know

128
00:10:47,821 --> 00:10:50,858
I don’t know… I don’t know

129
00:10:53,545 --> 00:10:55,730
Well… that’s okay, Sky.

130
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,687
Sky

131
00:11:00,509 --> 00:11:01,676
Have you worn this before?

132
00:11:02,574 --> 00:11:03,454
This raincoat

133
00:11:05,050 --> 00:11:08,301
Yes, I have. When it’s raining,

134
00:11:08,854 --> 00:11:10,780
I wear this raincoat.

135
00:11:11,461 --> 00:11:14,192
Well, if it’s raining you have to wear the raincoat.

136
00:11:14,349 --> 00:11:15,785
No, Sky… I mean

137
00:11:17,054 --> 00:11:20,832
Do you remember the last time you wear it? When was it, do you remember?

138
00:11:22,341 --> 00:11:25,327
I don’t know where it is

139
00:11:26,243 --> 00:11:27,821
I can’t remember

140
00:11:40,741 --> 00:11:41,621
Alright, Sky

141
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:46,010
I’ll let you see the pictures of these people.

142
00:11:47,389 --> 00:11:49,080
Can you tell me whether you know these people…

143
00:11:49,843 --> 00:11:51,258
Do you know them?

144
00:12:12,181 --> 00:12:15,789
This is Khun Anon, he hurted me.

145
00:12:16,487 --> 00:12:18,549
This is my beautiful girl, P’Ya.

146
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:21,381
This is the bright-faced monk.

147
00:12:21,949 --> 00:12:23,930
This is teacher Rapeephan

148
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:28,960
This…

149
00:12:32,643 --> 00:12:34,490
This... is my friend’s mother

150
00:12:35,505 --> 00:12:38,069
These two…

151
00:12:40,483 --> 00:12:41,570
I

152
00:12:43,472 --> 00:12:44,552
have seen…

153
00:12:46,501 --> 00:12:47,360
never seen…

154
00:12:48,523 --> 00:12:49,556
have seen…

155
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:53,229
never seen …

156
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,501
have seen…

157
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:58,780
never seen…

158
00:12:59,138 --> 00:13:00,490
Have you seen or never seen them, Sky?

159
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,658
I have seen them..

160
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,552
No… never seen them

161
00:13:06,065 --> 00:13:07,014
Inspector…

162
00:13:07,901 --> 00:13:11,541
I think she is not in a condition to give any statement.

163
00:13:12,269 --> 00:13:13,807
-I think we should stop here.
-I never saw them.

164
00:13:16,483 --> 00:13:17,250
Okay

165
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:20,450
Sky, Sky. It’s all done for today.

166
00:13:20,614 --> 00:13:21,720
I’m not going to ask you anything else.

167
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,789
Sky, Sky

168
00:13:25,549 --> 00:13:26,683
You don’t have to think about anything now.

169
00:13:26,734 --> 00:13:28,890
Don’t have to answer anything too. It’s enough.

170
00:13:29,432 --> 00:13:30,607
It’s enough, dear.

171
00:13:37,832 --> 00:13:38,556
Miss Sookwan…

172
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:44,269
I just want to say that there are less than thirty-six hours left for us to keep Sky in custody.

173
00:13:46,105 --> 00:13:47,061
So what now?

174
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:50,727
After this, we have to send her
to central prison as per the law.

175
00:13:53,450 --> 00:13:57,058
The evidence I brought,
the doctor's note, won't help at all?

176
00:13:57,580 --> 00:14:00,083
or how much money would it take?

177
00:14:00,705 --> 00:14:01,690
Here’s the thing, Miss Sookwan…

178
00:14:03,127 --> 00:14:07,640
The court will not grant bail for this case
because it's a serious crime

179
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:11,309
and it is one of the cases that get a lot of public attention

180
00:14:19,683 --> 00:14:23,352
Mom, why are you crying? Did I do anything wrong?

181
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:26,003
No, you didn’t do anything wrong, dear.

182
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:30,258
It’s not your fault.

183
00:14:31,890 --> 00:14:33,992
Then you shouldn’t cry, mom

184
00:14:34,574 --> 00:14:35,763
Please don’t cry

185
00:14:36,549 --> 00:14:37,840
don’t cry, okay?

186
00:14:37,985 --> 00:14:41,352
When we get home, I’ll get you a lollipop.

187
00:14:46,780 --> 00:14:47,480
Miss Sookwan

188
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,770
Miss Sookwan, you have to listen to me carefully.

189
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:51,490
After this

190
00:14:51,898 --> 00:14:55,658
If you can think of anything,
or any information about Sky…

191
00:14:56,625 --> 00:14:58,196
You have to tell me right away..

192
00:14:59,487 --> 00:15:01,054
If you want to help Sky…

193
00:15:13,352 --> 00:15:14,625
I miss Sergeant Moo.

194
00:15:15,283 --> 00:15:16,730
Don’t know how he’s doing now.

195
00:15:17,538 --> 00:15:20,778
They say he's getting much better. He should be able to return to work soon

196
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:22,780
Yeah, Lun

197
00:15:23,283 --> 00:15:25,767
Do you get anything from investigating Miss Sookwan?

198
00:15:26,380 --> 00:15:28,101
Is there anything suspicious?

199
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:30,160
Huh?

200
00:15:30,614 --> 00:15:31,600
No, nothing

201
00:15:33,247 --> 00:15:35,610
What about the syringe, the disinfectant,

202
00:15:36,167 --> 00:15:37,720
and the bulk of rubber gloves?

203
00:15:40,330 --> 00:15:43,465
This rubber gloves? I used to be a nurse.

204
00:15:43,898 --> 00:15:47,298
I got into the habit of wearing rubber gloves
whenever I do cleaning.

205
00:15:47,578 --> 00:15:52,556
Many autistic children are sensitive to fabrics or yarn.

206
00:15:52,938 --> 00:15:56,934
So I have to make my daughter
wear rubber gloves when she knits

207
00:15:57,803 --> 00:15:58,665
Don’t tell me…

208
00:15:59,632 --> 00:16:01,440
that the disinfectant is for the same reason?

209
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:04,694
The disinfectant used in the surgical room, as well?

210
00:16:05,396 --> 00:16:07,563
Yes, is that strange?

211
00:16:08,152 --> 00:16:10,414
What about the syringes? What are you using it for?

212
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:12,134
The syringe?

213
00:16:14,756 --> 00:16:19,043
- I use it to dye the yarn.
- Dyeing the yarn?

214
00:16:28,923 --> 00:16:31,970
Sometimes, I have to dye the yarn myself for sales.

215
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:38,280
The yarn comes in blocks, but sometimes when I boil it with dye, the color doesn't absorb.

216
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:44,120
So I have to use a syringe, inject the dye into yarns to make sure it’s evenly colored.

217
00:16:48,065 --> 00:16:49,923
And the surgical equipment?

218
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:52,436
Those surgical equipment belong
to Miss Sookwan’s father.

219
00:16:53,010 --> 00:16:54,527
He used to be a surgical doctor

220
00:16:55,047 --> 00:16:55,669
Then…

221
00:16:56,458 --> 00:16:57,410
She’s off the hook.

222
00:16:58,578 --> 00:17:01,269
But Sky… there’s no way she could get out of this.

223
00:17:12,701 --> 00:17:16,545
Sky, are you hungry yet?
I brought something for you. Wow!

224
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:19,112
Who brought so much for Sky?

225
00:17:20,061 --> 00:17:21,580
The police bought it for me.

226
00:17:21,894 --> 00:17:24,556
The police bought all my favorites.

227
00:17:26,607 --> 00:17:27,580
Sky

228
00:17:28,098 --> 00:17:31,349
Are you bored? You’ve been here,
didn’t get to go anywhere.

229
00:17:31,625 --> 00:17:33,658
The police told me to be patient.

230
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,745
So I have to be patient.

231
00:17:40,170 --> 00:17:43,180
Excuse me, I have to transfer
the suspect to the central prison.

232
00:17:45,981 --> 00:17:48,134
What... What’s going on?

233
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,927
I…I’m not going anywhere.

234
00:17:49,981 --> 00:17:53,360
What are you doing… Why are you arresting me?

235
00:17:53,527 --> 00:17:54,720
I’m not going

236
00:17:55,180 --> 00:17:59,705
I didn’t do anything… I’m not going no no no

237
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:02,247
- Let go of me!!
- Sky

238
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:03,912
Please help me, officer

239
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:06,792
Please help me, officer

240
00:18:07,618 --> 00:18:08,614
officer

241
00:18:08,669 --> 00:18:10,280
please help me

242
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:12,647
officer

243
00:18:14,021 --> 00:18:15,580
please help me

244
00:18:18,538 --> 00:18:20,607
Can you not cut my hair?

245
00:18:20,836 --> 00:18:23,803
Don’t cut my hair, don’t cut my hair…

246
00:18:25,589 --> 00:18:28,780
Can you please not cut my hair? Please.

247
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,560
Don’t cut my hair

248
00:18:33,010 --> 00:18:34,600
Don’t cut my hair

249
00:20:32,036 --> 00:20:34,254
So, the persone we caught doesn't have the murderer gene?

250
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:36,269
Yes, father

251
00:20:39,429 --> 00:20:41,752
This is going to affect you a lot.

252
00:20:42,709 --> 00:20:46,236
Your popularity will drop, and the chances of becoming the Prime Minister will be…

253
00:20:47,316 --> 00:20:47,980
hard

254
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:53,600
Forget about this, Pitak.

255
00:20:54,385 --> 00:20:55,225
If I didn't become one…

256
00:20:56,534 --> 00:20:57,356
then I didn’t become one.

257
00:20:58,483 --> 00:21:00,305
We have followed all the rules.

258
00:21:00,825 --> 00:21:02,803
Our intentions have always been for the people

259
00:21:03,290 --> 00:21:06,596
But the opposition will definitely
collaborate with the new government.

260
00:21:06,923 --> 00:21:08,380
They will use this murder case…

261
00:21:08,854 --> 00:21:11,258
to cancel the murderer gene law for sure.

262
00:21:15,989 --> 00:21:18,123
That’s something I worry about.

263
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:22,014
The safety of the people will be gone.

264
00:21:26,120 --> 00:21:26,992
But never mind.

265
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:32,101
Everyone has ups and downs.

266
00:21:38,167 --> 00:21:38,981
Down

267
00:21:40,480 --> 00:21:41,410
But soon, there will be ups.

268
