Once this case is done, they’re going to push for a law to control people with mental illnesses.

313
00:24:24,370 --> 00:24:25,480
Everyone’s equal

314
00:24:25,818 --> 00:24:26,800
Everyone’s equal

315
00:24:28,520 --> 00:24:29,640
