345
00:27:07,320 --> 00:27:07,920
Um

346
00:27:20,505 --> 00:27:21,349
Sky

347
00:27:23,061 --> 00:27:24,065
Look at the camera.

348
00:27:29,138 --> 00:27:30,010
Look at the camera.

349
