417
00:33:09,629 --> 00:33:10,512
Hey, Lan.

418
00:33:11,276 --> 00:33:13,374
Sis, calm down. Calm down

419
00:33:14,072 --> 00:33:16,269
- Calm down
- Let me tell you something.

420
00:33:17,021 --> 00:33:18,781
Since I’ve been with Sky from the start,

421
00:33:19,180 --> 00:33:22,694
