430
00:33:42,800 --> 00:33:44,120
The doctor already said that

431
00:33:44,174 --> 00:33:45,447
The connection between these

432
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:47,938
- personalities doesn’t link together.
-Oh, stop it, Lan. Stop. Enough

