526
00:41:10,065 --> 00:41:11,730
You didn’t help me

527
00:41:12,374 --> 00:41:14,080
You lied to me

528
00:41:15,316 --> 00:41:18,061
you… I hate you…

529
00:41:24,840 --> 00:41:26,432
